    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is it about?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The love of your life is waiting for you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Do you dare to live a unique story? Here you will find couples of all kinds: men, women and beyond your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to fall in love, create your path and discover how each step can change your destiny. Your story begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591060/extras/aa642b9a25dd742038dbff3e805ff594.poster.avif?t=1739122844\" width=352 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591060/extras/aa642b9a25dd742038dbff3e805ff594.webm?t=1739122844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591060/extras/aa642b9a25dd742038dbff3e805ff594.mp4?t=1739122844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A game that transforms with you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this visual novel, every choice you make will be a reflection of you. The story not only moves forward, but changes its tone, its essence and even its destiny according to the decisions you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you prefer a touch of mystery and darkness, or are you looking for laughter and unforgettable moments? This game is tailored to you, offering you a completely personalized experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the very first moment, you are in charge of the adventure, are you ready to discover how far your choices will take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591060/extras/2477ca9d7eb42aeff453defe25a25c95.avif?t=1739122844\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is in Early Access,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > offering you the first of many stories we have planned. In the future, more than <strong>15 original stories</strong> await you, each with its own style and special touches that will make you want to explore them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your opinion is key for us. If you decide to join this adventure, don't forget to leave a review about your experience. We will read every comment and work constantly to improve and offer you an unforgettable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for being part of this initial stage, your journey is just beginning, and we want you to grow with us!</p>",
